<https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#about> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relationship between a qcy:InformationObject and a qcy:CanonicalEntity. This property indicates that a file content or fragment is about a specific canonical entity. It can be implicitly derived that if a file content or fragment mentions the occurrence of a named entity, and that named entity resolves to a canonical entity, then the file content or fragment is about the canonical entity." .
