<https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#tableContent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\"Processed table output, which contains a json string with the content assigned to the cells, as extracted from the input.."@en .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#tableContent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "table grid content"@en .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#tableContent> <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#visibleForAgent> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
