<https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#tableGrid> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#tableGrid> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#TableFragment> .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#tableGrid> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#tableGrid> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Processed table output, which contains a json string with a grid of cells, as extracted from the input."@en .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#tableGrid> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "table grid"@en .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#tableGrid> <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#visibleForAgent> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
